###############################################################
# HTE Management Module
#
# Manual API Test Suite
# VS Code REST Client
#
# Includes:
# - HTE CRUD
# - HTE activation/deactivation
# - HTE supervisor assignment
# - Students assigned to a specific HTE
# - Students assigned to authenticated HTE supervisor
# - Validation
# - Authentication
# - Authorization
#
# Test order:
# 1. Variables
# 2. Health Check
# 3. Administrator Login
# 4. Coordinator Login
# 5. HTE Supervisor Login
# 6. HTE List
# 7. HTE Create
# 8. HTE Retrieve
# 9. HTE Update
# 10. HTE Assign Supervisor
# 11. HTE Students
# 12. HTE Supervisor Students
# 13. HTE Deactivate
# 14. HTE Reactivate
# 15. Validation Tests
# 16. Non-existent HTE
# 17. Authentication Tests
# 18. Authorization Tests
#
###############################################################


